※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4425 LANG_MATCH_FLAG_NEEDS_A_REST

※ The values of a flag enumeration are meant to be combined, so a value of one
※ may be a combination no single name stands for: naming every name does not
※ account for every value.

@[flag]
enum Perm { read ; write }

let mine: mut Perm = Perm.read

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    match mine:
        read:
            return 1u6
        write:
            return 2u6
